  "title": "Route Planning & Replanning Architecture",
  "diagramType": "subsystem-architecture",
  "description": "Internal architecture of three route planning engines: Global Route Planner (eng-plan-global-route) for end-to-end route computation and waypoint optimization; Local Replanner (eng-plan-local-replan) for plan monitoring, deviation detection, and local route repair; and Reactive Avoidance (eng-plan-reactive-avoidance) for real-time collision prevention. Details the layered planning hierarchy from global route through local replan to reactive maneuver, with integration to the Hybrid Coordinator, Motion Model Engine, COP terrain and obstacle data, Vehicle State Store, and Core Event Bus.",
